        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "５ターンの　あいだ　すなあらしで\nじめん　いわ　はがね　タイプいがいに\nダメージを　あたえる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "5턴 동안 모래바람으로\n바위, 땅, 강철타입 이외의\n포켓몬에게 데미지를 준다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Une tempête de sable qui blesse tous les\nPokémon durant cinq tours, sauf ceux de types\nRoche, Sol et Acier.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ein Sandsturm trifft für 5 Runden alle Pokémon,\naußer die vom Typ Boden, Gestein und Stahl.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ataque controlado que impide que el objetivo se\ndebilite al dejarle con un mínimo de 1 PS.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Causa una tempesta di sabbia per cinque turni\nche danneggia tutti i tipi in campo esclusi\nTerra, Roccia e Acciaio.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A five-turn sandstorm is summoned\nto hurt all combatants except for\nRock, Ground, and Steel types.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "５ターンの　あいだ　砂あらしで\nいわ　じめん　はがねタイプ　以外の\nポケモンに　ダメージを　与える。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ataque controlado que impide que el objetivo se\ndebilite al dejarle con un mínimo de 1 PS.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "５ターンの　あいだ　いわ　じめん\nはがねタイプ　いがいに　ダメージ。\nいわタイプの　とくぼうが　あがる。",
