        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "はげしい　ほのおを\nあいてに　はっしゃして　こうげきする。\nやけど　じょうたいに　することが　ある。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "세찬 불꽃을\n상대에게 발사하여 공격한다.\n화상 상태로 만들 때가 있다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "向對手發射\n強烈火焰進行攻擊。\n有時會讓對手陷入灼傷狀態。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "L’ennemi reçoit un torrent de flammes.\nPeut aussi le brûler.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Starke Feuer-Attacke, durch die das Ziel eventuell\nVerbrennungen erleidet.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ataca con una gran ráfaga de fuego que puede causar\nquemaduras.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Il bersaglio viene colpito da intense fiammate\nche possono anche scottarlo.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The target is scorched with an intense blast of fire.\nThis may also leave the target with a burn.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "激しい　炎を\n相手に　発射して　攻撃する。\nやけど状態に　することが　ある。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "向对手发射\n烈焰进行攻击。\n有时会让对手陷入灼伤状态。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ataca con una gran ráfaga de fuego que puede causar\nquemaduras.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "みかた　ぜんいんで　こうげきする。\nなかまの　ポケモンが　おおいほど\nわざの　こうげきかいすうが　ふえる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "같은 편 전원이 공격한다.\n동료 포켓몬이 많을수록\n기술의 공격 횟수가 증가한다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "讓我方所有寶可夢進行攻擊。\n同行的寶可夢越多，\n招式的攻擊次數越多。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Le lanceur appelle tous les Pokémon de son équipe\nà attaquer. Plus ils sont nombreux, plus il y a d’attaques.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Der Anwender greift zusammen mit allen Mitgliedern\nseines Teams das Ziel an. Je mehr Pokémon sich im\nTeam befinden, desto höher die Anzahl der Angriffe.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ataque de todo el equipo Pokémon. Cuantos más haya,\nmás veces se atacará.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Chi la usa chiama in aiuto i Pokémon della squadra:\npiù ce ne sono, maggiore è il numero di attacchi.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The user gets all party Pokémon to attack the target.\nThe more party Pokémon, the greater the number\nof attacks.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "味方　全員で　攻撃する。\n仲間の　ポケモンが　多いほど\n技の　攻撃回数が　増える。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "我方全员进行攻击。\n同行的宝可梦越多，\n招式的攻击次数越多。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ataque de todo el equipo Pokémon. Cuantos más haya,\nmás veces se atacará.",
